Priority: optional
Maintainer: maulusck <maulusck@users.noreply.github.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Rules-Requires-Root: binary-targets
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Homepage: https://github.com/Antynea/grub-btrfs

Package: grub-btrfs
Architecture: all
Depends: btrfs-progs, grub2-common, inotify-tools, snapper, ${misc:Depends}
Description: boot btrfs snapshots from the GRUB menu, wired to snapper
 Adds a GRUB submenu listing btrfs snapshots; the grub-btrfsd daemon
 regenerates it whenever a snapshot appears or disappears.
 .
 On a btrfs root this package creates the snapper "root" config, which
 activates snapper's apt hook: every apt transaction gets a pre/post
 snapshot that shows up as a bootable entry. grub-btrfs-restore(8) makes
 a snapshot the permanent root again.
